{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "29e1b77c-01f9-84e3-9ddd-0a4fab36786c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T12:23:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:21:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, dear. Yes, I hope you can help me. I was just going through my old winter coat this morning, found forty dollars in the pocket, and I thought, well, that's the only good thing that's happened since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water, honey. In my cellar. A few inches came seeping in after that coastal storm, the one Friday into Saturday. I've been in this house many years and it has never once done that. Never."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:20-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "380 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill. And the thing is, the street drain out front is just overflowing still, and the water's running down toward my neighbor's garage. It's not my garage, it's the neighbor's, and I don't like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it still coming into your cellar, or has it stopped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's slowed down, but the street's still wet and standing in that low spot. Three days now. Somebody should have come by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a work order for a crew to check that drain and the runoff. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194, got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, tell me, do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's going to sit until next Monday, I'd like to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They can be out on a weekend after a storm, but they're working through a long list this week. I'd expect someone in the next day or two, and I'll mark the neighbor's garage as a concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, all right. I'd appreciate that, dear. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Cordero. Take care."
    }
  ],
